<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "Take_It.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\背景\職員室.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "T" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"Sensei, please! Give <STYLE ID="1">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> one more chance!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE>Goto-san<STYLE ID="2">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">But it's already been decided under the rules we set at the start."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I know that, that's why I came all the way here to ask!
{PAUSE ""}
　With <STYLE ID="1">Kogori-senpai</STYLE>'s ability, I'm sure she could lead the team!
{PAUSE ""}
　So...!"<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"I know that full well. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Listen, in sports, you can't always compete at full strength. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Nobody can give 100% every single time. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">That's why you practice, so you can give 100% as often as possible. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Kogori</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s no different. This time she couldn't give 100%, so she didn't make the cut. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">If she'd been practicing properly all along―"</STYLE><PG>
"But with <STYLE ID="1">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> it's her constitution! Practice and effort can't do anything about it!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"By July, <STYLE ID="1">Kogori-senpai</STYLE>'s April sickness should be better. 
{PAUSE ""}
So..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Then who do I cut?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Huh?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"In place of </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kogori</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, who do I cut from the starting lineup?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　The six starters, the bench and the libero are all already set, so who do I cut?"</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "togisuma.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
"Even if you ask me who..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"At this point I can't tell anyone, 'I'm putting </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kogori</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> in, so you're out after all.' </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Listen, </STYLE>Goto-san<STYLE ID="2">, constitution or whatever, everyone went into the tryouts on April 6 under the same conditions. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Nobody cheated or pulled any tricks. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Could </STYLE>you, Goto-san<STYLE ID="2">, cut someone who won their place in fair tryouts?"</STYLE><PG>
"That's..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"I understand how you feel too, </STYLE>Goto-san<STYLE ID="2">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
Goto-san<STYLE ID="2">, you've been supporting </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kogori</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> behind everyone's back, after all."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"You knew...?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"So of course you'd want </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kogori</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> to become a starter more than anyone. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">But you know, if I had my way, I'd want everyone to be a starter. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">But the number of spots is fixed, so I have to narrow it down. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">That's why I held fair tryouts."</STYLE><PG>
"But at least a spot on the bench..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Then why did </STYLE>you, Goto-san<STYLE ID="2">, come to tell me?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Huh?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Why did </STYLE>you, Goto-san<STYLE ID="2">, come here, and not </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kogori</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　What did </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kogori</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> say?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"That she has no regrets anymore..."<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"That's the answer </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kogori</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> came to. Let's respect it. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Even if we knock someone else off now and put her on the bench, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kogori</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> would just feel awkward. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">She</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> doesn't want to be a starter so badly that she'd go that far. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Kogori</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> didn't want to be a starter; she wanted to be recognized as having what it takes to be one. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">That's what I think."</STYLE><PG>
"............"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Honestly, it hurts that </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kogori</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> isn't making the starting lineup. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">So if </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kogori</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> had said herself, 'I want one more chance,' I'd have considered it, and depending on the situation, swapping the lineup could have happened. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">But if that's not the case, then that's the end of it. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">If anything, putting </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kogori</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> on the team would only be a burden on </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">her</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">."</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "Talking_Time.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
"<STYLE ID="1">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> is... 
{PAUSE ""}
I see. I had it wrong. 
{PAUSE ""}
It's not so much that she wanted to be a starter; she wanted to be recognized. 
{PAUSE ""}
I was supporting her the whole time, and I didn't notice at all..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"At first </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">she</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> was clumsy and couldn't move, but she still didn't give up. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">And now, as you can see, she's a different person. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Isn't that enough on its own?"</STYLE><PG>
"Yes..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Most of all, I'd like </STYLE>you, Goto-san<STYLE ID="2">, to recognize that. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Kogori</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> must want recognition from </STYLE>you, Goto-san<STYLE ID="2">, more than from me or anyone else on the team."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Understood. I finally get it now."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"All right, it's late, so be careful going home."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Yes. Goodbye."
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
;---------------------------------------
; END DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------